            Weave(baseIndent=0)
              Text("replies")
      Text(", placing his own cup back on the table untouched. \u0022Such a curious flavour. It might almost not be tea at all. You might say it hides a multitude of sins. As do you. Isn\u0027t that right?\u0022")
      Text("\n")
      Choice(name="suppose_i_have", once=true, invisible=false, depth=1, inline=true)
